# "You may cast an Ally spell from among cards you own exiled with this creature." Changeling Wayfinder's changeling is a
# characteristic-defining ability that works in every zone (CR 702.73a, 604.3), so the spell it would be is every creature type,
# an Ally among them, and that is what is judged (CR 601.3e), not its printed type line (Shapeshifter). Bolted, it is exiled
# from Bot1's graveyard with the Rioter by tapping Earth Kingdom Protectors; when the Rioter attacks, it is cast from exile
# (the trigger's default answer takes it) and resolves onto the battlefield.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
